---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BRAND_CONFIG } from '../config/brand.config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | BidWise Marketing"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection standards for BidWise Marketing, a Delaware US-based performance agency."
>
  <div class="legal-page-section section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="glass-card legal-card">
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: February 2026</p>

        <div class="legal-content">
          <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            {BRAND_CONFIG.legalName} ("BidWise Marketing", "we", "us", or "our"), located at {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.street}, {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.city}, {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.state} {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.postalCode}, {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.country}, is committed to safeguarding the privacy and personal data of our website visitors, clients, and prospective partners.
          </p>

          <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect personal information strictly when provided voluntarily through our contact and audit request forms:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Identification Data:</strong> Full name, company/website URL.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Work email address, telephone number (if provided).</li>
            <li><strong>Inquiry Context:</strong> Service interest, current marketing spend band, and project descriptions.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical Telemetry:</strong> Anonymized usage data collected via Google Tag Manager and analytics tools (only when consented).</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
          <p>Your information is used exclusively for:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Responding to direct project inquiries and consulting requests.</li>
            <li>Conducting requested Google Ads account audits and preparing diagnostic reports.</li>
            <li>Fulfilling contractual obligations and issuing invoices.</li>
            <li>Improving our website performance, security, and user experience.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>We never sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties.</strong></p>

          <h2>4. Legal Basis for Processing &amp; Data Standards</h2>
          <p>We process your personal information under the following lawful standards:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Consent:</strong> When you submit an inquiry form or consent to optional analytical cookies.</li>
            <li><strong>Contractual Necessity:</strong> To take pre-contractual steps at your request before entering into a service agreement.</li>
            <li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> To operate our business securely, prevent fraud, and maintain network integrity.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>5. Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>
          <p>
            We retain personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected or to comply with statutory legal requirements. We enforce strict technical and organizational measures to prevent unauthorized access, loss, or disclosure.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Under applicable state and federal privacy laws, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict, or object to the processing of your personal data, as well as the right to opt-out of marketing communications. To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_CONFIG.contact.email}`} class="text-cyan">{BRAND_CONFIG.contact.email}</a>.
          </p>

          <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            For any inquiries regarding this Privacy Policy, please write to:<br />
            <strong>{BRAND_CONFIG.legalName}</strong><br />
            Attention: Privacy &amp; Compliance Team<br />
            {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.street}<br />
            {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.city}, {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.state} {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.postalCode}<br />
            {BRAND_CONFIG.contact.address.country}<br />
            Email: <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_CONFIG.contact.email}`} class="text-cyan">{BRAND_CONFIG.contact.email}</a><br />
            Phone / WhatsApp: <a href={`tel:${BRAND_CONFIG.contact.phoneTel}`} class="text-cyan">{BRAND_CONFIG.contact.phoneDisplay}</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page-section {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 50px);
  }

  .legal-card {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px;
    background: rgba(8, 22, 38, 0.8);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 32px 0 12px 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin: 12px 0 20px 24px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
